---
// Premier écran : slogan géant (lettres qui tombent, glitch sur « NOIR », FLUO plaqué),
// polaroid de la pièce phare et patchs à déplacer, sur le fond façon tissu éraflé du site.
import type { CollectionEntry } from 'astro:content';
import Garment from './Garment.astro';
import Icon from './Icon.astro';
import Patch from './Patch.astro';
import { formatPrix } from '../data/catalogue';
import { site } from '../data/site';

interface Props {
  /** Pièce phare, affichée sur le polaroid */
  vedette: CollectionEntry<'produits'>;
  /** Nombre de pièces du drop en cours */
  total: number;
}

const { vedette, total } = Astro.props;

// Découpe un mot en lettres pour l'animation d'entrée (l'index sert au décalage)
const letters = (word: string, start: number) => [...word].map((char, i) => ({ char, i: start + i }));
---

<section class="hero" data-hero aria-labelledby="hero-title">
  <div class="hero__meta">
    <p class="kicker"><span class="live-dot"></span>Drop {site.drop.numero} en ligne</p>
    <p class="hero__meta-mid">{site.drop.saison} · {total} pièces · stock limité</p>
    <p>Paris <time data-clock>--:--:--</time></p>
  </div>

  <h1 class="hero__title" id="hero-title">
    <span class="sr-only">{site.slogan} {site.nom}</span>
    <span class="hero__lines" aria-hidden="true">
      <span class="hero__line">
        <span class="hero__word glitch" data-text="NOIR">
          {letters('NOIR', 0).map(({ char, i }) => <span class="ch" style={`--i: ${i}`}>{char}</span>)}
        </span>
        <span class="hero__word hero__word--outline">
          {letters('DEHORS.', 4).map(({ char, i }) => <span class="ch" style={`--i: ${i}`}>{char}</span>)}
        </span>
      </span>
      <span class="hero__line">
        <span class="hero__word hero__word--fluo">FLUO</span>
        <span class="hero__word">
          {letters('DEDANS.', 13).map(({ char, i }) => <span class="ch" style={`--i: ${i}`}>{char}</span>)}
        </span>
      </span>
      <span class="hero__tag gothic">Tom Boutique</span>
    </span>
  </h1>

  <div class="hero__bottom">
    <p class="hero__lede">{site.description}</p>
    <div class="hero__ctas">
      <a class="btn" href="#drop" style="--c: var(--acide)">Voir le drop <Icon name="arrow" /></a>
      <a class="btn btn--ghost" href="#lookbook" style="--c: var(--rose)">Lookbook</a>
    </div>
  </div>

  <a class="hero__card" href="#drop" data-tilt data-cursor="Voir" style={`--c: var(--${vedette.data.couleur})`}>
    <span class="hero__card-inner">
      <span class="hero__card-tape" aria-hidden="true"></span>
      <span class="hero__card-img"><Garment type={vedette.data.categorie} /></span>
      <span class="hero__card-cap">
        <span>{vedette.data.nom}</span>
        <span>{formatPrix(vedette.data.prix)}</span>
      </span>
      <span class="hero__card-badge">Pièce phare</span>
    </span>
  </a>

  {/* L'étoile se colle pile sur le point de « DEHORS. » (grand écran) */}
  <Patch kind="star" color="rose" size={84} x="90.2%" y="18%" rotate={12} delay={1250} desktopOnly />
  <Patch kind="skull" color="acide" size={78} x="3%" y="50%" rotate={-8} speed={0.1} delay={1450} desktopOnly />
  <Patch
    kind="smiley"
    color="jaune"
    size={104}
    x="45%"
    y="66%"
    mobileX="70%"
    mobileY="21.5%"
    rotate={-14}
    speed={0.12}
    delay={1150}
  />
  <Patch
    kind="bpm"
    color="orange"
    size={118}
    x="58%"
    y="76%"
    mobileX="66%"
    mobileY="5%"
    rotate={8}
    speed={0.16}
    delay={1350}
  />
  <Patch
    kind="bolt"
    color="cyan"
    size={66}
    x="71%"
    y="52%"
    mobileX="7%"
    mobileY="36%"
    rotate={16}
    speed={-0.06}
    delay={1550}
  />
</section>

<script>
  // Horloge de Paris, à la seconde
  const clock = document.querySelector<HTMLElement>('[data-hero] [data-clock]');

  if (clock) {
    const format = new Intl.DateTimeFormat('fr-FR', {
      hour: '2-digit',
      minute: '2-digit',
      second: '2-digit',
      timeZone: 'Europe/Paris',
    });
    const tick = () => (clock.textContent = format.format(new Date()));
    tick();
    window.setInterval(tick, 1000);
  }
</script>

<style>
  .hero {
    position: relative;
    isolation: isolate;
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: minmax(0, 1fr) clamp(210px, 20vw, 300px);
    grid-template-areas:
      'meta meta'
      'title title'
      'bottom card';
    align-content: start;
    gap: clamp(20px, 2.6vw, 36px) clamp(24px, 4vw, 64px);
    min-height: calc(100svh - var(--hdr-h) - 34px);
    padding: clamp(18px, 2.4vw, 30px) var(--gutter) clamp(120px, 12vw, 180px);
  }

  /* --- Méta en haut --- */

  .hero__meta {
    grid-area: meta;
    display: flex;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: space-between;
    gap: 8px 24px;
    font-size: 12px;
    font-weight: 700;
    letter-spacing: 0.12em;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    color: var(--gris);
  }

  .hero__meta .kicker {
    color: var(--blanc);
  }

  .hero__meta time {
    color: var(--acide);
    font-variant-numeric: tabular-nums;
  }

  /* --- Le slogan géant --- */

  .hero__title {
    grid-area: title;
    position: relative;
    z-index: 2;
    font-family: var(--f-display);
    font-size: clamp(76px, 14.4vw, 290px);
    font-weight: 900;
    font-stretch: 86%;
    line-height: 0.8;
    letter-spacing: -0.01em;
    text-transform: uppercase;
  }

  .hero__lines {
    position: relative;
    display: block;
  }

  .hero__line {
    display: flex;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
    column-gap: 0.14em;
  }

  .hero__word {
    position: relative;
    display: inline-flex;
  }

  .ch {
    display: inline-block;
  }

  .hero__word--outline {
    color: transparent;
    -webkit-text-stroke: 0.022em var(--blanc);
  }

  .hero__word--fluo {
    color: var(--acide);
  }

  .hero__tag {
    position: absolute;
    top: 36%;
    left: 30%;
    font-size: 0.36em;
    line-height: 1;
    white-space: nowrap;
    color: var(--rose);
    rotate: -8deg;
    -webkit-text-stroke: 0.05em var(--noir);
    paint-order: stroke fill;
    text-shadow: 0.05em 0.06em 0 var(--noir);
  }

  /* Glitch RGB sur « NOIR » : une petite salve toutes les 6 secondes */
  .glitch::before,
  .glitch::after {
    content: attr(data-text);
    position: absolute;
    top: 0;
    left: 0;
    opacity: 0;
    pointer-events: none;
  }

  .glitch::before {
    color: var(--cyan);
    animation: glitch-a 6s steps(1, end) 3s infinite;
  }

  .glitch::after {
    color: var(--rose);
    animation: glitch-b 6s steps(1, end) 3s infinite;
  }

  @keyframes glitch-a {
    0%,
    90%,
    100% {
      opacity: 0;
      transform: none;
      clip-path: inset(0);
    }
    91% {
      opacity: 0.9;
      transform: translate(-0.04em, 0.01em);
      clip-path: inset(12% 0 58% 0);
    }
    93% {
      opacity: 0.9;
      transform: translate(0.03em, -0.01em);
      clip-path: inset(62% 0 6% 0);
    }
    95% {
      opacity: 0.9;
      transform: translate(-0.02em, 0);
      clip-path: inset(38% 0 36% 0);
    }
    96% {
      opacity: 0;
    }
  }

  @keyframes glitch-b {
    0%,
    90%,
    100% {
      opacity: 0;
      transform: none;
      clip-path: inset(0);
    }
    91.5% {
      opacity: 0.9;
      transform: translate(0.04em, -0.01em);
      clip-path: inset(48% 0 24% 0);
    }
    94% {
      opacity: 0.9;
      transform: translate(-0.03em, 0.02em);
      clip-path: inset(8% 0 70% 0);
    }
    96% {
      opacity: 0;
    }
  }

  /* --- Bas du hero --- */

  .hero__bottom {
    grid-area: bottom;
    position: relative;
    z-index: 2;
    display: grid;
    gap: 24px;
    align-self: end;
    max-width: 560px;
  }

  .hero__lede {
    font-size: clamp(14px, 1.15vw, 17px);
    line-height: 1.65;
    color: color-mix(in srgb, var(--blanc) 82%, transparent);
  }

  .hero__ctas {
    display: flex;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
    gap: 16px;
  }

  /* --- Polaroid de la pièce phare --- */

  .hero__card {
    grid-area: card;
    position: relative;
    z-index: 3;
    align-self: end;
    justify-self: end;
    width: 100%;
    margin-top: clamp(-40px, -2.4vw, -16px);
  }

  .hero__card-inner {
    position: relative;
    display: block;
    padding: 12px 12px 14px;
    color: var(--noir);
    background: var(--blanc);
    box-shadow:
      0 30px 60px -20px rgb(0 0 0 / 0.9),
      8px 8px 0 var(--c);
    rotate: 4deg;
    transform: perspective(900px) rotateX(var(--rx, 0deg)) rotateY(var(--ry, 0deg));
    transition:
      transform 0.5s var(--ease-out),
      rotate 0.5s var(--ease-back);
    animation: hero-float 5s ease-in-out infinite alternate;
  }

  @keyframes hero-float {
    from {
      translate: 0 -6px;
    }
    to {
      translate: 0 8px;
    }
  }

  .hero__card-img {
    position: relative;
    display: block;
    aspect-ratio: 1;
    overflow: hidden;
    background:
      radial-gradient(rgb(0 0 0 / 0.18) 1.1px, transparent 1.6px) 0 0 / 7px 7px,
      var(--c);
  }

  .hero__card-img :global(.garment) {
    width: 86%;
    height: 86%;
    margin: 7%;
    transition: transform 0.6s var(--ease-back);
  }

  .hero__card-cap {
    display: flex;
    justify-content: space-between;
    gap: 10px;
    margin-top: 10px;
    font-size: 13px;
    font-weight: 700;
    letter-spacing: 0.04em;
    text-transform: uppercase;
  }

  .hero__card-tape {
    position: absolute;
    top: -14px;
    left: 50%;
    z-index: 2;
    width: 120px;
    height: 32px;
    translate: -50% 0;
    rotate: -6deg;
    background: color-mix(in srgb, var(--cyan) 80%, transparent);
    box-shadow: 0 2px 6px rgb(0 0 0 / 0.25);
  }

  .hero__card-badge {
    position: absolute;
    top: 22%;
    right: -18px;
    padding: 8px 12px;
    font-size: 11px;
    font-weight: 700;
    letter-spacing: 0.1em;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    color: var(--acide);
    background: var(--noir);
    border: 2px solid var(--acide);
    rotate: 10deg;
  }

  @media (hover: hover) {
    .hero__card:hover .hero__card-inner {
      rotate: 0deg;
    }

    .hero__card:hover .hero__card-img :global(.garment) {
      transform: rotate(-6deg) scale(1.08);
    }
  }

  /* --- Entrée : les lettres tombent, FLUO est plaqué, la signature est tamponnée --- */

  :global(html.js) .hero .ch {
    opacity: 0;
    transform: translateY(-0.55em) rotate(-12deg);
    transition:
      opacity 0.25s,
      transform 0.9s var(--ease-back);
    transition-delay: calc(var(--i) * 45ms + 120ms);
  }

  :global(html.is-ready) .hero .ch {
    opacity: 1;
    transform: none;
  }

  :global(html.js) .hero__word--fluo {
    opacity: 0;
    transform: scale(2.2) rotate(-14deg);
    transition:
      opacity 0.2s 0.62s,
      transform 0.8s var(--ease-back) 0.62s;
  }

  :global(html.is-ready) .hero__word--fluo {
    opacity: 1;
    transform: rotate(-2deg);
  }

  :global(html.js) .hero__tag {
    opacity: 0;
    scale: 1.9;
    transition:
      opacity 0.2s 1.05s,
      scale 0.55s var(--ease-back) 1.05s;
  }

  :global(html.is-ready) .hero__tag {
    opacity: 1;
    scale: 1;
  }

  :global(html.js) .hero__meta,
  :global(html.js) .hero__bottom {
    opacity: 0;
    transform: translateY(24px);
    transition:
      opacity 0.7s var(--ease-out),
      transform 0.9s var(--ease-out);
  }

  :global(html.js) .hero__bottom {
    transition-delay: 0.95s;
  }

  :global(html.is-ready) .hero__meta,
  :global(html.is-ready) .hero__bottom {
    opacity: 1;
    transform: none;
  }

  :global(html.js) .hero__card {
    opacity: 0;
    transform: translateY(40%) rotate(18deg);
    transition:
      opacity 0.4s 1.1s,
      transform 1s var(--ease-back) 1.1s;
  }

  :global(html.is-ready) .hero__card {
    opacity: 1;
    transform: none;
  }

  /* --- Mobile : un mot par ligne, polaroid au centre --- */

  @media (max-width: 760px) {
    .hero {
      grid-template-columns: minmax(0, 1fr);
      grid-template-areas:
        'meta'
        'title'
        'card'
        'bottom';
      min-height: 0;
      padding-bottom: 130px;
    }

    .hero__meta-mid {
      display: none;
    }

    .hero__title {
      font-size: clamp(64px, 25vw, 150px);
      font-stretch: 66%;
    }

    .hero__line {
      display: block;
    }

    .hero__word {
      display: flex;
    }

    .hero__tag {
      top: 47%;
      left: 12%;
      font-size: 0.32em;
    }

    .hero__card {
      justify-self: center;
      width: min(250px, 72vw);
      margin-top: -12vw;
    }
  }
</style>
